    return heading('错题练习','收录的错题自动来到这里：原题整题答对一次即已掌握，衍生题到“温习一下”继续巩固。',`<button class="btn dark" data-action="workbook-today" ${!dueQuestions.length?'disabled':''}>练习今天的 ${Math.min(5,dueQuestions.length)} 道原题</button>`,'学会一题，比刷过一题更重要')+(book?`<section class="panel" style="margin-bottom:20px"><h2>本次已完成 ${completed} 道原题</h2><p class="sub">${book.ids.length-completed} 道稍后继续。答题记录已经保存。</p></section>`:'')+`<section class="panel"><div class="section-head"><h2>${questions.length} 道错题 · ${dueQuestions.length} 道今日可练</h2><button class="link-btn" data-nav="library">返回错题本</button></div>${questions.map(q=>{const e=originalEvidence(q);return `<div class="question-row"><div class="q-info"><h3>${esc(q.title)}</h3><p class="meta">${!workbookReady(q)?'题目待补全 · 原图保留':e.mastered?'原题已掌握':e.last?.correct?'已做对 · 已掌握':e.last?'继续订正':'还没重做原题'}</p></div><button class="btn small" ${workbookReady(q)?`data-original-question="${esc(q.id)}"`:`data-open="${esc(q.id)}"`}>${workbookReady(q)?'重做原题':'查看保留的题目'}</button></div>`;}).join('')||'<p class="sub">先收录一道错题，或完成一次知识练习，错题会自动进入练习册。</p>'}</section>`;
